---
title: "Order Processing & Inventory Routing Flow"
---
flowchart LR
  Client[Client Request] --> Gateway{API Gateway}
  Gateway -->|Auth Valid| Auth[Auth Service]
  Gateway -->|Invalid| Reject[Reject Request]
  Auth --> Engine[Processing Engine]
  Engine --> Inventory{Check Stock}
  Inventory -->|In Stock| Fulfill[Fulfill Order]
  Inventory -->|Out of Stock| Backorder[Backorder]
  Backorder -->|Retry| Engine
  Fulfill --> Ship((Ship Package))
  Backorder --> Notify((Notify User))
